---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Resumé - Claire Nyquist | Public Health Data Visualization"
    description="Public health data visualization analyst and designer. MPH from the University of Minnesota, design degree from the University of Westminster, working code in R, Python, JavaScript, and D3. Experience with HHS/ASPR, the Minnesota Department of Health, and ICF."
>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
                Resumé
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                I pair a Master of Public Health with a design degree and
                creative code. I've analyzed, visualized, and communicated
                health data for the U.S. Department of Health &amp; Human
                Services, the Minnesota Department of Health, the Minneapolis
                Health Department, and Robert Wood Johnson Foundation programs —
                and I founded tcplot, the Twin Cities data visualization
                community.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Experience -->
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-8">
                Experience
            </h2>

            <div class="space-y-8">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <div
                        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start mb-4"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                Data Visualization Analyst, Developer, and
                                Designer
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">Independent</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2 md:mt-0">
                            January 2025 - Present
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                        <li>
                            Designed and built this site — 25+ interactive data
                            visualization projects, created with JavaScript, D3,
                            R, and Python on Astro.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Built <a
                                href="/themet"
                                class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800"
                                >an interactive explorer of 1,000+ Met Museum
                                artworks</a
                            > with custom canvas rendering and scroll-driven animation.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Built <a
                                href="/meps"
                                class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800"
                                >an animated D3 dashboard of the Medical
                                Expenditure Panel Survey</a
                            > (AHRQ), with documented normalization methods.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Founded and organize <a
                                href="/tcplot"
                                class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800"
                                >tcplot</a
                            >, the Twin Cities data visualization and creative
                            coding meetup.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <div
                        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start mb-4"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                Public Health Preparedness & Communications
                                Analyst
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">ICF</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2 md:mt-0">
                            January 2022 - May 2025
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                        <li>
                            Compiled, cleaned, analyzed, and visualized data in
                            R and Excel for the U.S. Department of Health &amp;
                            Human Services' ASPR TRACIE program.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Conducted literature reviews and integrated current
                            research, policy updates, and best practices into
                            emergency preparedness plans, training modules, and
                            response strategies used by hospitals across the
                            U.S.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Wrote articles on vaccines, global health, and
                            health equity for the Robert Wood Johnson
                            Foundation/Tulane University Partners for Advancing
                            Health Equity program.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Organized online workshops and managed deliverables
                            end to end.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <div
                        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start mb-4"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                Graduate Student Worker
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">
                                Minnesota Department of Health
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2 md:mt-0">
                            December 2020 - January 2022
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                        <li>
                            Coordinated operations for COVID-19 vaccine
                            distribution across the state of Minnesota.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Redistributed over 150,000 doses of COVID-19 vaccine
                            from providers with excess to providers who could
                            use them before expiration.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Managed multiple databases for COVID-19 vaccine
                            provider enrollment.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <div
                        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start mb-4"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                Graduate Student Intern
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">
                                Minneapolis Health Department
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2 md:mt-0">
                            June 2020 - November 2020
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                        <li>
                            Researched and designed <a
                                href="/ppe-instructions"
                                class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800"
                                >an information graphic on the correct procedure
                                for donning PPE</a
                            >.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Interviewed long-term care facility administrators
                            on barriers to PPE supply during COVID-19 and
                            reported findings to the department.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <div
                        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start mb-4"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                Graduate Student Worker
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">
                                Healthy Eating Research, Robert Wood Johnson
                                Foundation
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2 md:mt-0">
                            October 2019 - December 2020
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                        <li>
                            Created data visualizations from program metrics and
                            scientific articles.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Developed semi-annual communications reports on
                            email and social media campaign performance.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Researched, reviewed, and summarized journal
                            articles for the program's website.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <div
                        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:justify-between md:items-start mb-4"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                Earlier: Clinical Research & Medical Scribe
                                Roles
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">
                                Massachusetts General Hospital · Brigham and
                                Women's Hospital · Children's Minnesota ·
                                University of Minnesota
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2 md:mt-0">
                            2016 - 2019
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                        <li>
                            Coordinated clinical research studies, including a
                            study using children's cough recordings to diagnose
                            respiratory illness; recruited and consented
                            patients in English and Spanish.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Documented patient encounters in a pediatric
                            emergency room, interpreting laboratory and imaging
                            data alongside physicians.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Developed a PCR assay for a porcine respiratory
                            virus at the University of Minnesota Veterinary
                            Diagnostic Laboratory.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Awards -->
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-8">Awards</h2>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                    <li>
                        ASPR Pledge to Excellence Award — U.S. Department of
                        Health and Human Services.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Partners for Advancing Health Equity 2024 Delivery
                        Excellence Award — ICF.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Education -->
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-8">Education</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">
                        Master of Public Health
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium mb-2">
                        Public Health Administration and Policy
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2">
                        University of Minnesota • December 2021 • GPA 3.96
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
                        Focused on global health security and infectious disease
                        preparedness. Coursework included epidemiology,
                        biostatistics, data visualization in R, surveillance of
                        zoonotic pathogens, and public health policy. Master's
                        thesis: a systematic review of COVID-19 disruptions to
                        essential medicine supply chains.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">
                        Bachelor of Arts
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium mb-2">
                        Graphic Communication Design
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-2">
                        University of Westminster • June 2015 • First Class
                        Honors
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
                        Specialized in science communication through design:
                        data visualization, user experience design, and
                        typography. Built <a
                            href="/gene-editing-perspectives"
                            class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800"
                            >an interactive installation on public opinion about
                            gene editing</a
                        >.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Skills -->
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-8">Skills</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                        Code &amp; Data
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• R and Python for analysis and visualization</li>
                        <li>• JavaScript, D3.js, HTML, CSS</li>
                        <li>• Web development and design</li>
                        <li>• Data cleaning and statistical display</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                        Design
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• Graphic communication design</li>
                        <li>
                            • Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator,
                            InDesign, After Effects, Premiere Pro)
                        </li>
                        <li>• User experience design</li>
                        <li>• Typography and information design</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                        Public Health
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• Epidemiology and infectious disease research</li>
                        <li>• Literature reviews and research methods</li>
                        <li>• Science and health communication</li>
                        <li>• Emergency preparedness</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Community -->
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-8">Community</h2>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Founder and Organizer, tcplot</strong> — data visualization
                        and creative coding meetups for the Twin Cities (2026–present).
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong
                            >Discovery Days Volunteer, Minneapolis Institute of
                            Art</strong
                        > — facilitated art discussions with elementary school groups
                        (2025–2026).
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong
                            >Inventors Club Volunteer, The Bakken Museum</strong
                        > — supported children's hands-on engineering projects (2023–2024).
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
